	mesh = {Base Sequence; Chromosome Mapping; Crosses, Genetic; DNA, Fungal; Genetic Markers; Genotype; Models, Genetic; Molecular Sequence Data; Phytophthora; Polymerase Chain Reaction; Polymorphism, Genetic; Polymorphism, Restriction Fragment Length; Polymorphism, Single-Stranded Conformational; Random Amplified Polymorphic DNA Technique; Restriction Mapping},
