	annote = {The paper arose from reading Eshel (1984) and a difficulty in understanding his proof of an approximation to the survival probability of a mutlitype Bianaym{\'e}-Galton-Watson process and its subsequent application to the determination of the survival probability of a mutant gene. It is shown that Eshel's (1984) approximation applies only under certain condidtions.

